  "finding": "The change did not deliver in the real push path. Its own census gate rejected the faster build on 12 transactions, so the frontend and overlay pass ran as well and the transaction paid two engine starts instead of one. Every workload kept the same p50 and the verdict stayed NO-GO, so it was reverted.",
